<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: "20px 72px", background: "#F5E3BE", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 122, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>体量：三个数字</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 10 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.62)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginTop: 8 }}>规模不是目标，是可维护性的自然结果：模块数多，是因为每条技术线都被单独抽出来治理过</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 510, flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: "column", height: "100%", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-end", gap: 28 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 92, fontWeight: "bold", lineHeight: 1.0, color: "#B3271E", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", width: 200 }}>3</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 8, paddingBottom: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>个棋种，共享一套引擎</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.75)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>六子棋 / 五子棋 / 中国象棋。差异被严格约束在棋盘尺寸、连子数、每轮子数、AI 后端四个维度，其余全部复用同一份代码。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-end", gap: 28 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 92, fontWeight: "bold", lineHeight: 1.0, color: "#8C5A2B", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", width: 200 }}>20+</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 8, paddingBottom: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>个模块，全链路自研</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.75)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>覆盖渲染、音频、AI 引擎、数据存档与打包分发，从界面到算法没有借任何外部游戏框架。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-end", gap: 28 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 92, fontWeight: "bold", lineHeight: 1.0, color: "#8C5A2B", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif", width: 200 }}>5</Text>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", gap: 8, paddingBottom: 10 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>轮迭代，每轮走完整闭环</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.7, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.75)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>每一轮都走完「现象 → 根因 → 修复 → 验证」，没有一轮是表面修补。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", background: "rgba(42,33,24,0.94)", borderLeft: "5px solid #B3271E", borderRadius: 6, padding: "10px 20px", marginTop: 4 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, lineHeight: 1.45, color: "rgba(245,227,190,0.92)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>这三个数字的真正含义：3 代表复用成立，20+ 代表职责分离，5 代表方法可重复。</Text>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 48, flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "space-between" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.55)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>弈趣棋苑 · 项目开发汇报</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.55)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>06 / 64</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>